{%- comment -%}
  tonescan-landing
  ----------------
  Code-first, dark, professional SaaS landing page for the tonescan app.
  Rendered via templates/page.tonescan.liquid using layout/tonescan.liquid
  (real shop logo + theme fonts; no shop header/footer).

  CONVENTIONS:
  - Tailwind v4, prefix-first: tw:flex, tw:md:grid, tw:hover:opacity-90.
  - Dark theme. Accent = BLUE: #3b82f6 (buttons/dots/borders), #60a5fa (eyebrow text).
  - MINIMAL corner radius: tw:rounded-[2px] on cards/frames/buttons/tiles/badges (pro-software vibe).
    rounded-full ONLY on tiny indicator dots.
  - Container matches the main site: max-w-[1400px], px-[15px] md:px-[50px] (logo click doesn't jump).
  - Arbitrary PX for type/spacing (theme root is 62.5%). Layout utils (flex/grid) are safe.
  - COPY RULE: sell tangible benefits, never the tech stack. RGB trichromatic support is the
    key differentiator — it leads.
  - Content is plain inline HTML — edit copy directly.
  - Status: OPEN BETA (free now; perpetual + subscription at launch). "(soon)" = not shipped.
  - Scroll reveal + hero parallax wired in layout/tonescan.liquid (fails safe).
  - Placeholders in [ brackets ] / grey boxes: screenshots, testimonials, prices, real social proof.
{%- endcomment -%}

